<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50611" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">versābĭlis</span></b> , e,
			adj.
		verso, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>movable</i>, <i>mobile; changeable</i>, <i>mutable</i>, <i>versatile</i>
			(postAug.; cf.: mutabilis, variabilis). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aër,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Q. N. 6, 16, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">repagulum, of a cage,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 19, 6, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">acies,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Curt. 4, 13, 32</span></i>
			. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">omnis condicio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Tranq. 11, 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fortuna,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Curt.
					5, 8, 15</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">femina,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 16, 8, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ad momentum omne,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 15, 5, 30</span></i>
			.</div>
